    "name": "Idol Party 2 - Love Vibe",
    "steam_appid": 3798230,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Rhythm &amp; Dance Gameplay\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a massive music library, you can dance freely to the beat and show off your talent, enjoying the thrill and excitement of rhythm-based competition. Featuring a brand-new note drop system and satisfying gameplay feel,  making you feel like you're on a real dance stage as you embark on a journey full of challenges and surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798230/extras/3a7b878f09e0fa45ac690b2a932d4ce9.poster.avif?t=1755488019\" width=624 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798230/extras/3a7b878f09e0fa45ac690b2a932d4ce9.webm?t=1755488019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798230/extras/3a7b878f09e0fa45ac690b2a932d4ce9.mp4?t=1755488019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Fashion DIY\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to crafting outfits, you can also set up your own DIY fashion studio in the town and create your own unique clothing for free! With a variety of materials, stickers, accessories, and tools provided in-game, you can unleash your creativity to design custom high-fashion pieces. What kind of look will you create for your stage? Let your imagination run wild!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798230/extras/66685fd5e458ffc93d139db6419c238e.poster.avif?t=1755488019\" width=624 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798230/extras/66685fd5e458ffc93d139db6419c238e.webm?t=1755488019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798230/extras/66685fd5e458ffc93d139db6419c238e.mp4?t=1755488019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Romantic Bonds\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet that special someone through dancing and adventure. Dance together, explore together, and unlock exclusive interactions and sweet rewards. As your bond deepens, you can even hold a romantic ceremony under the stars and start a journey that belongs only to the two of you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798230/extras/7bc12dd8e6bbd0a8d1e9422e396005fd.poster.avif?t=1755488019\" width=624 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798230/extras/7bc12dd8e6bbd0a8d1e9422e396005fd.webm?t=1755488019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798230/extras/7bc12dd8e6bbd0a8d1e9422e396005fd.mp4?t=1755488019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Social Interaction\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Starry Town, surprises and mysteries await around every corner. Ride a variety of uniquely designed mounts and freely explore floating islands, each with their own distinct style. Along the way, you can play and have fun with friends, interact with colorful NPCs, and discover delightful surprises by engaging with mysterious items and props scattered throughout the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798230/extras/e3e12355803fb66938937c151eb99e70.poster.avif?t=1755488019\" width=624 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798230/extras/e3e12355803fb66938937c151eb99e70.webm?t=1755488019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798230/extras/e3e12355803fb66938937c151eb99e70.mp4?t=1755488019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Rhythm &amp; Dance Gameplay\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a massive music library, you can dance freely to the beat and show off your talent, enjoying the thrill and excitement of rhythm-based competition. Featuring a brand-new note drop system and satisfying gameplay feel,  making you feel like you're on a real dance stage as you embark on a journey full of challenges and surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798230/extras/3a7b878f09e0fa45ac690b2a932d4ce9.poster.avif?t=1755488019\" width=624 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798230/extras/3a7b878f09e0fa45ac690b2a932d4ce9.webm?t=1755488019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798230/extras/3a7b878f09e0fa45ac690b2a932d4ce9.mp4?t=1755488019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Fashion DIY\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to crafting outfits, you can also set up your own DIY fashion studio in the town and create your own unique clothing for free! With a variety of materials, stickers, accessories, and tools provided in-game, you can unleash your creativity to design custom high-fashion pieces. What kind of look will you create for your stage? Let your imagination run wild!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798230/extras/66685fd5e458ffc93d139db6419c238e.poster.avif?t=1755488019\" width=624 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798230/extras/66685fd5e458ffc93d139db6419c238e.webm?t=1755488019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798230/extras/66685fd5e458ffc93d139db6419c238e.mp4?t=1755488019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Romantic Bonds\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet that special someone through dancing and adventure. Dance together, explore together, and unlock exclusive interactions and sweet rewards. As your bond deepens, you can even hold a romantic ceremony under the stars and start a journey that belongs only to the two of you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798230/extras/7bc12dd8e6bbd0a8d1e9422e396005fd.poster.avif?t=1755488019\" width=624 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798230/extras/7bc12dd8e6bbd0a8d1e9422e396005fd.webm?t=1755488019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798230/extras/7bc12dd8e6bbd0a8d1e9422e396005fd.mp4?t=1755488019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Social Interaction\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Starry Town, surprises and mysteries await around every corner. Ride a variety of uniquely designed mounts and freely explore floating islands, each with their own distinct style. Along the way, you can play and have fun with friends, interact with colorful NPCs, and discover delightful surprises by engaging with mysterious items and props scattered throughout the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798230/extras/e3e12355803fb66938937c151eb99e70.poster.avif?t=1755488019\" width=624 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798230/extras/e3e12355803fb66938937c151eb99e70.webm?t=1755488019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798230/extras/e3e12355803fb66938937c151eb99e70.mp4?t=1755488019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
